| Non-emphasis tags to the program's codes
| This should be run last, after character and apostrophe treatment.
| 1;1 1995-2-7 JES - adapted from admtxt.sbt 1;3 1993-5-28/31
|     1995-2-22 JES - accept dollar processing codes
|     1995-3-10 JES - change = to ~ for "rest is arbitrary"
| 1;2 1995-4-28 JES - eliminate remaining spaces around tags
|     1995-5-23 JES - upd comment [vers#] only
| 2;1 1995-9-29 JES - changes for import into templates with LINEAR styles
| 2;2 1995-12-28 JES - specifically treat h1-h6, not any h...;
|     include HTML "title" so not misprocessed as ti, & other HTML;
|     rename ipp to ref.pg.no
|     1995-12-29 JES - (temporarily?) issue hl1 i.s.o. hl code for list items
| 2;3 1996-6-4 PJS: change to use |258 as line ending (new scrub convention)
| 2;4 1998-9-23 JES: foll'g chg in sgmspc.sbt, use |010 i.s.o. |258 for eol;
|     make some exceptions to general space deletion around tags (a, code)
| 2;5 2000-4-11 JES: add <acronym> to codes keeping some surrounding spaces
| 2;6 2000-5-26 JES: (per input from PS & DH): add line to handle processing
|     instruction preceded by space, which was being missed
| 2;7 2003-4-11 JES: change <it>, <b> and <other> treatment to use [fts~...]
|     (were formerly turned into underscore treatment in prior ewoc step)
|     2003-4-23 JES: like daitxx 1;3 2003-4-22, include only
|     "pro tem" exceptions to UTF-8 to DUSCI conversion
| 2;8 2003-9-9 JES: fix comments that were being treated as element names;
|     remove "meta" tags
| 2;9 2006-5-25 PJS: Improved handling of embedded script, style defs,
|     font defs, <div> tags, link tags.
|     2006-11-30 MPG: Added mapping of bc-ns to support bc: codes
|     from XML imports
|     2007-3-2 MPG: Add mapping for above when preceded by space
| 2007-3-6 MPG: Convert _ to ~ in state 9 since libxslt can't write a ~
|     2007-9-7 MPG: Add special codes for href links
| 2007-9-11 MPG: Convert <bc:tab/> to [>] code
| 2007-12-28 MPG: Remove <![if]> and <![endif]>, and convert &quot;
| 2;10 2009-9-4 PJS: Update handling of Registered, Copyright, and Trade
|      Mark symbols
| 2;11 2010-12-17/jes: Add certain inline tags whose names are to be preserved
|      and where any surrounding spaces are also to be preserved (see dated entries)
| 3;1  2010-12-20/jes: Allow for the possibility that "native" the program commands in TXX
|      form, including [es~...] and [ee~...] as well as [<] and [>] commands, may
|      already be present in the input, and if so should be copied through
|      without interpretation.  (Earlier xmlproc may do this in the program as of date.)
| 3;2  2011-05-11/jes: Add special treatment for "welsh" style similar to that for
|      french, spanish etc. (see updates 2010-12-17)
| 3;3  2013-04-21/jes: Cease mapping en- and em-dash to double hyphen (--)
|      (leave as UTF-8 for later mapping, e.g. in unimap.txt)
| 3;4  2014-08-21/pjs: added cleanup of xmlns:bc and xmlns:bcml in state 9
| 3;5  2015-01-21/jes: remove "pro tem" mapping of specific opening/closing
|      single and double quote marks to ` and " respectively, as these are
|      now being handled by separate, later logic and ` in particular is
|      problematic when an apostrophe, as in the word "don't", has been
|      imported as U+2019 (right single quote)
| ---
| states: 1 = normal text
|   2 = inside inkprint page (<ipp no=...>) tag
|   3 = inside general (or unrecognized) begin-tag
|   4 = inside general (or unrecognized) end-tag
|   5 = inside processing code
|   6 = inside general begin-tag for linear style
|   7 = inside general end-tag for linear style
|   8 = like 4, but where foll'g space IS to be kept
|   9 = inside <bc:.../>
|  10 = inside |028 ... |031 (native txx) the program command (added 2010-12-20)
|   -1 = in <!-- ... --> (ignored comment)
|   -2 = in < ... > (certain ignored tags)
|   -3 = inside processing code to be discarded
|   -4 = in comment to be ignored, but with pending space
| ---
| SGML comments:
<!--~~1~-1~ | beginning of comment to be ignored
 <!--~~1~-4~ | beginning of comment to be ignored, with pending space
<~~-1~ | don't treat mentions of tags when in state -1; discard & proceed
>~~-1~
<~~-4~ | same in state -4
>~~-4~
-->~~-1~1~ | end of comment with no pending space
--> ~ ~-4~1~ | end of comment - ensure at least 1 space, but not 2
-->~ ~-4~1~ | end of comment - ensure at least 1 space
 <!doctype>~~1~ | doctype can be discarded
<!doctype>~~1~
| MS Office directives
<![if>~~1~
<![endif]>~~1~
